# OPTIONAL — rename to `packages.txt` only if you want server-side PDF preview.
#
# Read this first: these apt packages are roughly 1.5 GB installed. Streamlit
# Community Cloud will often time out or run out of disk during the build, and
# you will get a broken app rather than a slow one. The recommended setup is to
# leave this file alone and compile in Overleaf, where your real .cls already
# lives and the output is guaranteed to match your current resume.
texlive-latex-recommended
texlive-latex-extra
texlive-fonts-recommended
texlive-xetex
latexmk
